  "messages": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "customer_id": "C001",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Hi, can tell me when oat milk is back? Been out for 2 weeks already",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "customer_id": "C001",
      "sender": "store",
      "text": "Sorry ah! Supplier delay. We'll let you know once it's in",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "customer_id": "C001",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Ok thanks. Also planning my son's birthday party end Oct, you all got party snack packs?",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "customer_id": "C001",
      "sender": "store",
      "text": "Yes we have! $12 and $20 sizes",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "customer_id": "C002",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "My order supposed to come 4pm, now 7pm still nothing",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "customer_id": "C002",
      "sender": "store",
      "text": "So sorry Marcus, driver got stuck. It's on the way now",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "customer_id": "C002",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Reached already but the frozen dumplings all soft. Not happy leh",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "customer_id": "C002",
      "sender": "store",
      "text": "Really sorry about that. We'll do better",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-03T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "customer_id": "C003",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Hello, Deepavali coming, you all bring in ghee and the spice packs again this year?",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-05T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "customer_id": "C003",
      "sender": "store",
      "text": "Yes! Deepavali ghee and spice packs coming in mid Oct",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-05T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "customer_id": "C003",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Great, I need a lot, cooking for the whole family",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-05T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "customer_id": "C004",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Got durian this season or not?",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-09-20T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "customer_id": "C004",
      "sender": "store",
      "text": "Seasonal durian in stock now, limited boxes",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-09-20T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "customer_id": "C004",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Nice. Also your frozen dumplings which brand ah? My kids like",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-09-21T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "customer_id": "C004",
      "sender": "store",
      "text": "Our own Kampung Fresh brand, pork and chive",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-09-21T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "customer_id": "C005",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Assalamualaikum, free-range eggs finish already?",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-09-25T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "customer_id": "C005",
      "sender": "store",
      "text": "Waalaikumsalam, yes sold out, next batch next week",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-09-25T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "customer_id": "C005",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Ok please tell me when come, I only buy those",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-09-25T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "customer_id": "C006",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Why your eggs more ex than NTUC ah",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-09-18T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "customer_id": "C006",
      "sender": "store",
      "text": "Ours are free-range from Malaysia farms, but we hear you",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-09-18T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "customer_id": "C006",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Ok la quality is good. Just delivery fee also quite ex",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-09-18T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "customer_id": "C007",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Hi! Office potluck next Friday, you all got party snack packs?",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-08T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "customer_id": "C007",
      "sender": "store",
      "text": "Yes we do, $12 and $20 sizes, can deliver to office",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-08T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "customer_id": "C007",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Ok let me check with colleagues how many people first",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-08T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "customer_id": "C008",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "If I order Gardenia bread at 1pm can reach today?",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-09-15T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "customer_id": "C008",
      "sender": "store",
      "text": "Yes, same-day delivery for orders before 2pm",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-09-15T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "customer_id": "C008",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Ok good to know",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-09-15T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "customer_id": "C009",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Delivery came 2 hours late and the ice cream melted",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-09-27T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "customer_id": "C009",
      "sender": "store",
      "text": "We're very sorry Nurul. We'll refund the ice cream",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-09-27T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "customer_id": "C009",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Ok thanks for the refund. Hope next time ok",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "customer_id": "C010",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Pokka green tea carton got stock?",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-01T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "customer_id": "C010",
      "sender": "store",
      "text": "Out for now, restocking soon",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-01T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "customer_id": "C010",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Ok I wait. Usually I buy 2 cartons a month",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-01T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "customer_id": "C011",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Do you deliver to Jurong West?",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-08-10T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "customer_id": "C011",
      "sender": "store",
      "text": "Sorry, we only deliver within Tampines and Pasir Ris for now",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-08-10T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "customer_id": "C012",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Your opening hours on Sunday?",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-07-19T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "customer_id": "C012",
      "sender": "store",
      "text": "8am to 9pm daily",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-07-19T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "customer_id": "C012",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Ok thanks",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-07-19T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "customer_id": "C013",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Your rice quite ex compared to supermarket",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "customer_id": "C013",
      "sender": "store",
      "text": "Thanks for the feedback, ours is premium Thai jasmine",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "customer_id": "C013",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "I just buy the cheap one la",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-08-02T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "customer_id": "C014",
      "sender": "customer",
      "text": "Hi I moved to Woodlands already, can remove me from list?",
      "handover": false,
      "created_at": "2026-06-30T04:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "customer_id": "C014",
      "sender": "store",
